-  source R / G / B / A
-  source read: .. glError .. componentType .. redBits ..
-  source CENTER R / G / B / A
-  Specular main-pass gate: max height .., last gated height ..
-  Native SSR specular matches soften-light source: YES/no
+One overlay screenshot plus one FX diagnostic screenshot:
+  - overlay must say: SL_GBUFFER_SPECULAR FX source: GATED MAIN-PASS SNAPSHOT
+  - Display Mode -> G-buffer specular RGB on the same known test object
 
-See RUN_AND_INTERPRET.txt.
+Do not re-run source acquisition troubleshooting unless the overlay falls back to
+DIRECT or NONE. v0.10 source proof remains authoritative.
